  "ruleText": "Ncr 311.05 Exceptions. The natural heritage bureau shall grant exceptions to Ncr 301-Ncr 311 to the extent that such action meets the requirements of Ncr 311.01.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ncr 300) #12980, eff 1-24-20",
